Subject: PLTA-24-3 – Sign Incentives Text Amendment
Date:
April 22, 2024

Background:
The item for consideration is a UDC Text Amendment. This is approved by Ordinance.

The proposed Governing Body review schedule is as follows:
•
Introduction and Referral
4/22/2024
•
Public Services Committee
5/7/2024
•
Second reading

5/13/2024
•
Public Services Committee
5/21/2024
•
Third and final reading
5/28/2024

Planning Commission Recommendation:
The Planning Commission heard this item at their April 15, 2024, meeting. The Planning Commission
Staff Report included options for consideration of alternative heights and areas. After debate, the
Planning Commission settled on the alternative presented by Staff – unanimously voting to recommend
the Governing Body approve the proposed text amendment as presented by Staff.

The Planning Commission Staff report is attached and has not been changed.

Attachments:
